      "rationale": "Only the ordinary 72-hour branch is encoded. Scope requires no shorter posted limit, no other legal authorization, no authorized-municipal-vehicle exclusion, and no junk-vehicle exclusion. The module does not infer that scope from silence. This is a machine-assisted historical assessment at the Long decision snapshot, not an independently reviewed citator result or a statement of current validity."
    },
